	<h1 class="title mb-12">About</h1>
	<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
		<p>
			I'm currently a research scholar and a PhD candidate in the <a href="https://www.tifr.res.in/dcmpms/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Department of Condensed Matter Physics & Materials Science (DCMPMS)</a> at the <a href="https://main.tifr.res.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tata Institute of Fundamental Research (TIFR)</a>, Mumbai, working on optimizing control and readout signals of superconducting qubits using machine learning. On a bigger scale, my aim is to contribute towards building fault-tolerant quantum computers. I graduated from the <a href="https://iitr.ac.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Indian Institute of Technology Roorkee</a> with an Integrated Master of Science in Physics. My past research interests have been in studying condensed matter systems that host novel states of matter and using atomistic simulations to calculate material properties.
		</p>
		<p>
		Outsite of academia, I'm interested in graphic and UI/UX design. You can check out my <a href="https://parthbahuguna.framer.website/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">design portfolio</a>. I've performed in various flagship events and competitions as a drummer of the Music Section, IIT Roorkee, the clips of some of which are available on <a href="https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLU9RLnhgqJ8dnzQ37hfdc_UYgFE9vwx2x&si=fpt6om0XWEp2OygD" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">You</a> <a href="https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLU9RLnhgqJ8fAzl8qz_6u8gI80WDAMrz6&si=-f9RwPbDrQIP_L9B" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tube</a>. I've recently picked up a 7-string electric guitar and would like to make it as a metal/djent guitarist. I also like to <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/142458103-parth" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">read</a> and <a href="https://letterboxd.com/y2kparth/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">watch films</a>. 
		</p>
